  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Puan: `(rate_b - rate_a) * 100`.",
      "en": "Points: `(rate_b - rate_a) * 100`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Göreli: `(rate_b - rate_a) / rate_a * 100`.",
      "en": "Relative: `(rate_b - rate_a) / rate_a * 100`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef lift(rate_a, rate_b):\n    points = (rate_b - rate_a) * 100\n    relative = (rate_b - rate_a) / rate_a * 100\n    return [round(points, 2), round(relative, 1)]\n\n\nprint(lift(0.117, 0.122))\nprint(lift(0.30, 0.27))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef lift(rate_a, rate_b):\n    points = (rate_b - rate_a) * 100\n    relative = (rate_b - rate_a) / rate_a * 100\n    return [round(points, 2), round(relative, 1)]\n\n\nprint(lift(0.117, 0.122))\nprint(lift(0.30, 0.27))\n```"
    }
  ],
